1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,700
A blind student can feel the shape of a
heart on a raised sheet.

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,700
Talking Tactile tells them what they are
touching.

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,944
The teacher uploads the textbook figure.

4
00:00:16,944 --> 00:00:22,749
Muse Spark reads it and plans each part
for touch.

5
00:00:22,749 --> 00:00:26,000
SAM 3.1 outlines every part.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,779
Code, not the model, decides the geometry:
gaps, textures, braille.

7
00:00:33,779 --> 00:00:39,700
What the models were unsure of goes to the
teacher.

8
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:45,269
Nothing is touchable until the teacher
checks it.

9
00:00:45,269 --> 00:00:51,455
Publishing refuses a sheet that breaks a
tactile design rule.

10
00:00:51,455 --> 00:00:54,700
The sheet prints at exact scale.

11
00:00:55,300 --> 00:01:02,020
On the student's side, a phone camera
watches the sheet.

12
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:06,700
Its corners tie the camera to the page.

13
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:11,104
Each part has its own tone.

14
00:01:11,104 --> 00:01:21,388
Rest a finger and the phone says the
part's name, with no network at all.

15
00:01:21,388 --> 00:01:29,700
Say "tell me more" to hear what the
teacher wrote about it.

16
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:41,700
Directions come from the sheet's geometry,
never from a language model.

17
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,551
Hold to ask.

18
00:01:43,551 --> 00:01:51,891
Muse Voice Transcribe hears the question,
with the figure's part names as hints.

19
00:01:51,891 --> 00:01:56,166
Muse Spark answers only from this figure.

20
00:01:56,166 --> 00:02:03,464
If the figure does not say, it tells the
student to ask their teacher.

21
00:02:03,464 --> 00:02:10,970
In our live tests, 36 of 38 heart
questions were answered from the right

22
00:02:10,970 --> 00:02:11,700
source.

23
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:23,700
With the network gone, touch still works,
and the phone says what does not.

24
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:35,700
The same steps work on a second figure.

25
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:39,320
Talking Tactile.

26
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:49,700
Built on Muse Spark, SAM 3.1 and Muse
Voice Transcribe.
